  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 2.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gange ælc man þæs to gewitnesse þe he durre on þam haligdóme swerian þe him on hand sylð.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And a man shall appear as witness to such things [only] as he is prepared to swear to on the relics which are given unto his hand.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et eat omnis homo ad testificandum illud, unde possit et uelit et audeat in sanctis iurare, quod ei dabitur in manibus.</ab>
      </div>
